% Required Face-to-Face Encounter and WOPD List carries the code descriptors).
PMD code "K0800" describes scooter of group 1 in weight class standard with no power option, as stated in the CMS required face-to-face list, confer "K0800 Power operated vehicle, group 1 standard, patient weight capacity up to and including 300 pounds".
PMD code "K0801" describes scooter of group 1 in weight class heavy duty with no power option, as stated in the CMS required face-to-face list, confer "K0801 Power operated vehicle, group 1 heavy duty, patient weight capacity, 301 to 450 pounds".
