PMD code "K0868" describes power wheelchair of group 4 in weight class standard with no power option, as stated in LCD L33789, confer "Group 4 PWCs (K0868,K0869, K0870, K0871, K0877, K0878, K0879, K0880, K0884, K0885, K0886) have added capabilities that are not needed for use in the home".
